	(descr "TAG-CONNECT ICSP Connector - Legged versionManufacturer: http://www.tag-connect.com Tag-Connect\n\nCable for easy In-Circuit Serial Programming. Designed for Microchip ICD2, suitable for many others.\n\nNOTE: Eagle's default spacing for drill holes does not leave sufficent room for routing traces for this footprint and should be adjusted.\nThis setting can be found in the board layout editor under the Edit menu.  Select \"Design Rules\" and then the Distance tab.  8 mils for Drill/Hole works well.\nPADDescription 1MCLR/Vpp 2Vdd 3GND 4PGD (ISPDAT) 5PGC (ISPCLK) 6nc (used for LVP)   ©2009 ROFA.cz - modified and updated by Robert Darlington ‹rdarlington@gmail.com›")
